            "line": 33,
            "kind": "directory",
            "excerpt": "**N:** `Nonuniqueness-with-local-conservation-for-the-hard-sphere-Boltzmann-equation-October-5-2026`. `build/paper/01-introduction.tex`, `thm:main` and `def:admissible`, give a datum on **T³×R³**, bounded in velocity support and finite in mass, energy and absolute entropy, with two distinct global entropy solutions. Both are strongly continuous in L¹; gains and losses separately have every polynomial velocity moment "
          },
